# ALLOWLIST. Everything in this project is ignored by default: planning documents (docs/, histoPlan.md,
# README.md), data (data_raw/, data_clean/), literature and supplements (copyright), images, model
# fits (outputs/), compiled Stan executables, and local tool settings (.claude/).
# Tracked: model and staging source code (src/*.R, *.stan, *.py; JM 2026-11-14: public is fine),
# the measuring tool (measure/) and repository plumbing (.github/, this file).
# To track something new, add an explicit "!" rule below and check `git status --ignored` first.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.github/
!/measure/
# src: source files only (compiled Stan executables and anything else stay out)
!/src/
/src/*
!/src/*.R
!/src/*.r
!/src/*.stan
!/src/*.py
!/src/*.sh

# ---- never commit these, even inside allowed folders ----
# images and documents (published figures are copyrighted; the tool reads images from a local folder)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.gif
*.webp
*.svs
*.ndpi
*.pdf
*.epub
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.ppt
*.pptx
# data and model files
*.csv
*.tsv
*.rds
*.RData
*.rda
*.nwk
*.nex
*.zip
# image folders, manifests and measurement exports
**/manifest.json
**/manifest.csv
**/exports/
*__*__*.json
# allowed exceptions: synthetic test images and icons generated for the tool
!/measure/fixtures/synthetic/**
!/measure/public/icons/**

# ---- build and system clutter ----
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
coverage/
*.log
.env
.env.*
.DS_Store
._*
Icon?
*.swp
